    {
      "id": "12dd4e5a-d275-43e0-b355-0dfbfb23d73a",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -352,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1104,
        "height": 768,
        "content": "## Workflow Overview: Slack Negotiation Co-Pilot & Intelligence Assistant\n\nThis workflow acts as a real-time **AI Negotiation Co-Pilot** for procurement teams. It bridges Slack and external data sources by instantly analyzing historical supplier deals and live market commodity prices to generate dynamic intelligence reports. During live supplier calls, it captures conversational pushback via interactive modals and delivers immediate, data-driven counter-tactics while automatically logging session metrics for future tracking.\n\n## How it works\n\nThis workflow acts as an automated tactical assistant for your procurement department. When you run a slash command in Slack, it aggregates historical supplier records and live global market prices to evaluate bargaining leverage. It posts a comprehensive intelligence report directly into your channel with predefined pushback scenarios and an interactive \"Generate Live Counteroffer\" button. When clicked, a modal prompts you for the supplier's live feedback; the AI instantly evaluates it against your strategic baseline and posts a punchy counter-tactic while logging the entire interaction into Google Sheets.\n\n## Setup Steps\n\n* **Webhook Response** \u2014 Trigger the workflow via a Slack slash command or button interaction.\n\n\n* **Route Slack Payload** \u2014 Centralized switch node to manage slash commands, button actions, and modal submissions.\n\n\n* **Fetch Market & History** \u2014 Pull live commodity pricing from Alpha Vantage and historical contracts from Google Sheets.\n\n\n* **AI Profile & Scenarios** \u2014 Leverage LLMs (Groq) to analyze pricing flexibility and generate multi-scenario counter-strategies.\n\n\n* **Render Intelligence Report** \u2014 Post a structured Block Kit card with interactive buttons to Slack.\n\n\n* **Launch Interactive Modal** \u2014 Open a secure pop-up window in Slack to capture live, mid-call supplier feedback.\n\n\n* **Generate Live Counter-Tactic** \u2014 Stream user input through AI to produce a fast, tactical response.\n\n\n* **Log Negotiation Insights** \u2014 Persist session variables, strategies, and outcomes back to Google Sheets for auditing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
